<!DOCTYPE html><!--m_4YUayESoAF9vUV3mAIx--><html lang="zh-TW"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.dbea232f.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.853070df.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/chen-hero.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/chen-carrefour-1.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/chen-professional.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/chen-interview.jpg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/QrCode.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/chunks/5ae6979303552536.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/4b9eae0c8dc7e975.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/f2f58a7e93290fbb.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/a90b6d11afe742e2.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-1e9ff4ec3e6618de.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/74369d15342189f6.js" async=""></script><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><title>陳彥廷競選網站 | 三重蘆洲議員候選人 | 民眾黨</title><meta name="description" content="三重蘆洲議員候選人陳彥廷，台大光電碩士，15年家樂福實戰經驗。專注三蘆交通改善、智慧城市建設、庶民經濟升級。用科技專業打造三蘆新未來。"/><meta name="author" content="陳彥廷競選團隊"/><meta name="keywords" content="三重蘆洲議員候選人,陳彥廷,民眾黨,三蘆交通,三重蘆洲議員,新北市議員選舉,智慧城市,交通改善,庶民經濟,科技治理"/><meta name="creator" content="陳彥廷競選團隊"/><meta name="publisher" content="陳彥廷競選團隊"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1"/><meta property="og:title" content="陳彥廷競選網站 | 三重蘆洲議員候選人"/><meta property="og:description" content="台大光電碩士，15年家樂福實戰經驗。專注三蘆交通改善、智慧城市建設、庶民經濟升級。"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://andy.believe.tw"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="陳彥廷競選網站"/><meta property="og:locale" content="zh_TW"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="陳彥廷競選網站 | 三重蘆洲議員候選人"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="台大光電碩士，15年家樂福實戰經驗。專注三蘆交通改善、智慧城市建設、庶民經濟升級。"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico" sizes="256x256" type="image/x-icon"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable antialiased"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 font-sans text-gray-900"><nav class="fixed w-full bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 shadow-sm"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#28C8C8]">陳彥廷 Yen-Ting</div><div class="space-x-6 hidden md:flex"><a href="#about" class="hover:text-[#28C8C8] transition">關於彥廷</a><a href="#policies" class="hover:text-[#28C8C8] transition">核心政見</a><a href="#contact" class="hover:text-[#28C8C8] transition">加入我們</a></div><button class="md:hidden text-gray-900"><div class="space-y-1"><div class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-gray-900 transition-all "></div><div class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-gray-900 transition-all "></div><div class="w-6 h-0.5 bg-gray-900 transition-all "></div></div></button><button class="bg-[#28C8C8] text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-[#1fa0a0] transition hidden md:block">贊助支持</button></div></nav><section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#28C8C8]/10 to-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:gap-12"><div class="md:w-1/2 mb-10 md:mb-0"><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-10 leading-tight">從 <span class="text-[#28C8C8]">台大光電</span> 到 <span class="text-blue-600">三蘆街頭</span></h1><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">家樂福 15 年資深經歷，用科技解決生活問題，讓三蘆升級 2.0。</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row space-y-4 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-4"><a href="#policies" class="bg-gray-900 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition text-center">看政見</a><a href="#contact" class="border-2 border-gray-900 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition text-center">加入志工</a></div></div><div class="md:w-1/2"><div class="w-full h-80 bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 italic overflow-hidden"><img src="/chen-hero.jpg" alt="陳彥廷在超市冷藏櫃前檢視商品" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></div></div></div></section><section id="about" class="py-12 bg-white border-y border-gray-100"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center"><div><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#28C8C8]">0<!-- --> 年</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">賣場基層服務</div></div><div><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#28C8C8]">台大碩士</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">光電專業背景</div></div><div><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#28C8C8]">0<!-- --> 里</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">三蘆民生共感及改善計劃</div></div><div><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#28C8C8]">AI 驅動</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">智慧城市轉型</div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">15 年，我在收銀台與貨架間，看見了三蘆的真實輪廓。</h2><div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700"><p class="text-lg">很多人問我：「彥廷，你是台大光電碩士，為什麼會去家樂福待了 15 年？現在為什麼又要出來選議員？」</p><p>在台大的實驗室裡，我學會的是<strong class="text-[#28C8C8]">「精準」</strong>；但在家樂福的 15 年裡，我學會的是<strong class="text-[#28C8C8]">「共感」</strong>。</p><div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-[#28C8C8]"><p class="mb-4"><strong class="text-xl">我是那個處理過無數抱怨的服務員：</strong>在賣場第一線，我聽過無數長輩抱怨物價上漲，看過年輕父母為了挑選一罐奶粉猶豫不決。我知道當政策變成冰冷的數字時，對基層家庭來說，那可能是實實在在的生存壓力。</p><p><strong class="text-xl">我是那個管理複雜供應鏈的理工男：</strong>15 年的通路經驗，讓我明白一個系統要運轉得順暢，靠的不是口號，而是邏輯與數據。三蘆的交通、排水、都市更新，其實就像一座巨大的賣場，需要的是精準的調度與科學的管理。</p></div><blockquote class="text-2xl font-bold text-center text-[#28C8C8] py-4">「政治不應該是高高在上的表演，而是柴米油鹽的專業。」</blockquote><p>我沒有顯赫的政治家世，但我有最接地氣的服務靈魂。我懂你在橋頭塞車的焦慮，懂你在市場買菜的精打細算。這一次，我想用我的光電專業與實戰經驗，把科技帶進三蘆的巷弄，把效率帶回市議會。</p><p class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">我是陳彥廷，你最專業的鄰居。</p></div><div class="mt-8"><button class="bg-[#28C8C8] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#1fa0a0] transition shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1">我想聽更多彥廷的科學治水方案</button></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-12"><div class="w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img src="/chen-carrefour-1.jpg" alt="陳彥廷穿著家樂福制服工作" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></div><div class="w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img src="/chen-professional.jpg" alt="陳彥廷專業西裝照" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></div><div class="w-full h-48 bg-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden"><img src="/chen-interview.jpg" alt="陳彥廷在超市接受採訪" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/></div><div class="w-full h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white p-4"><div class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">科技</div><div class="text-2xl">+</div><div class="text-lg font-bold mt-2">民生</div></div></div><div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 bg-[#28C8C8] text-white rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-bold shadow-xl">15 年實戰經驗</div></div></div></section><section id="policies" class="py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-16 underline decoration-[#28C8C8] decoration-4 underline-offset-8">核心政見</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden"><div class="p-8"><div class="text-4xl mb-4">🚗</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900">智慧交通 2.0</h3><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#28C8C8] mb-3">讓通勤不再是懲罰</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">用 AI 演算替代死板號誌，還給三蘆人每天 30 分鐘。</p><button class="w-full bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">查看具體方案<span class="transform transition-transform duration-200 ">▼</span></button></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden"><div class="p-8"><div class="text-4xl mb-4">🏪</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900">庶民經濟升級</h3><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#28C8C8] mb-3">賣場老兵的民生改革</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">導入通路管理經驗，讓傳統市場好買、好賣、好生活。</p><button class="w-full bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">查看具體方案<span class="transform transition-transform duration-200 ">▼</span></button></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden"><div class="p-8"><div class="text-4xl mb-4">🛡️</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900">科技安全社區</h3><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#28C8C8] mb-3">給長輩最數位化的守護</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">用 IoT 技術織成安全網，讓老舊公寓擁有智慧保全。</p><button class="w-full bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">查看具體方案<span class="transform transition-transform duration-200 ">▼</span></button></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 text-center"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 border-l-4 border-[#28C8C8]"><p class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">我是陳彥廷，我用理工男的邏輯解決問題。</p><p class="text-gray-700">這些不是夢想，是我在 15 年職涯中驗證過的可行方案。</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 px-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#28C8C8]/5 to-blue-600/5"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-12"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">【三蘆數位服務處】你的電費繳對了嗎？</h2><p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">過去的傳統選戰太花錢了，民主不應靠金錢堆砌。<br class="hidden md:block"/>我們要用最少預算打一場清新選戰。</p><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 mb-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100"><p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">我是政治素人，政治菜鳥，但我有一個想法：<br class="hidden md:block"/>要創造新北市三重蘆洲區市議員候選人花最少預算當選的一個記錄。</p><p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">從線上直接服務大家，我們打造線上網站來服務157個里，<br class="hidden md:block"/>不管是街頭巷尾小店家，或是社區大樓。</p></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#28C8C8]/10 to-blue-600/10 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8"><p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3"><span class="text-[#28C8C8] font-bold">我不在乎對手掛多少競選看板廣告</span><br/><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">我只在乎各社區各民眾有多少錢掉到地上卻不知道</span></p><p class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-medium">大家都可以利用彥廷的網站把掉到地上的錢撿起來<br/><span class="text-sm text-gray-600">（許多店家及大樓電費並沒有最佳化，無形中多繳了電費）</span></p></div><div class="bg-[#28C8C8]/10 rounded-2xl p-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#28C8C8] mb-3">核心戰術：【三蘆省錢計畫：把掉在地上的錢撿起來】</h3><p class="text-gray-700">這不只是一個程式，這是陳彥廷的<strong>「數位服務處」</strong>。 傳統議員送水、送面紙，陳彥廷直接幫你送錢（節省電費）。</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8"><div class="text-center mb-8"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#28C8C8]/10 rounded-full px-6 py-3 mb-6"><span class="text-2xl">⚡</span><span class="font-bold text-[#28C8C8]">30 秒電費健檢</span></div><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">幫助三蘆居民和店家找出最優電費方案，每年省下數千元電費</p></div><div class="text-center"><button class="bg-[#28C8C8] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#1fa0a0] transition shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1 inline-flex items-center gap-3"><span>💰</span><span>立即開始 30 秒電費健檢</span><span>→</span></button></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12"><div class="text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">🏢</div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">大樓管委會</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">每年幫社區省下 5~10 萬電費，公設電費優化</p></div><div class="text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">🏪</div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">街頭小店家</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">小吃店、理髮廳電費優化，減輕經營負擔</p></div><div class="text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl"><div class="text-3xl mb-4">📊</div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">157 個里</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">即時排行榜，顯示已幫三蘆省下的金額</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 mt-8"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-8 text-gray-800">服務成果實時統計</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6"><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#28C8C8] mb-2">5</div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">服務戶數</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-2">$98,965</div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">累計省錢</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">3</div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">覆蓋里數</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="text-3xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2">80%</div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">優化成功率</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="py-20 bg-gray-900 text-white text-center"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">三蘆的未來，缺你不可</h2><p class="mb-10 text-gray-400">無論是提供建議、或是加入我們成為行動志工，我們都張開雙臂歡迎你。</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-8"><button class="bg-[#28C8C8] text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(40,200,200,0.5)] transition">立即填寫志工表單</button><button class="border-2 border-white text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 transition">贊助支持</button></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4"><div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-lg"><img src="/QrCode.jpg" alt="LINE 後援會 QR Code" class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto mb-2"/><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center">掃描加入 LINE 後援會</p></div><div class="flex justify-center gap-4"><a href="https://line.me/ti/g2/7Zb7YIzZ4jECxb5IoYQfZHcbVk4vpQwU4sBKcg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-green-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-green-700 transition inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span>LINE</span><span>後援會</span></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1DCmo4rpuH/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-blue-700 transition inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span>f</span><span>FB 粉專</span></a></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4b9eae0c8dc7e975.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[47257,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js\"],\"ClientPageRoot\"]\n5:I[52683,[\"/_next/static/chunks/74369d15342189f6.js\"],\"default\"]\n8:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n9:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\nb:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nd:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2f236954d6a65e12.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\nf:I[68027,[],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/5ae6979303552536.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.dbea232f.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.853070df.woff2\",\"font\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\",\"type\":\"font/woff2\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"m_4YUayESoAF9vUV3mAIx\",\"c\":[\"\",\"\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"r